        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020487",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We consider our digital payment platform, which provides payment, financial, merchant, working capital solutions and other services to companies, marketplaces, e-commerce sellers, freelancers, and others, to be our proprietary technology.",
